      "caption_locator": null,
      "content": "On devices that do support concurrent data transfers, the two streams of the code sample of Creation and Destruction of Streams\ndo overlap: The memory copy from host to device issued to stream[1] overlaps with the memory copy from device to host issued to\nstream[0] and even with the kernel launch issued to stream[0] (assuming the device supports overlap of data transfer and kernel execution).",
      "truncated": false,
